15
00:02:01,840 --> 00:02:04,160
You can find me on Twitter and ask away.

16
00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:05,680
I'm not going to get into debates.

17
00:02:05,840 --> 00:02:07,040
I'm not going to get into arguments.

18
00:02:07,120 --> 00:02:19,280
