19
00:02:20,240 --> 00:02:24,400
And to all the black people listening right now, I just want to say I'm sorry.

20
00:02:24,880 --> 00:02:30,320
I'm sorry for what my ancestors did to your ancestors, the effect that has on you and your lives today.

21
00:02:30,800 --> 00:02:43,600
